                                "sense_id": "da12ef84-947d-321c-bb50-1d77715c376b",
                                "text": "'I was kinda sweet on her my own self. Sheba Otis, her name was then.' I was surprised. 'She married a Queen? Which one?' 'Can't say.' He sighed. 'Her name's Bathsheba, but she never liked that much.' He turned to look at me. 'That's one of them Bible names.'"
                            }
